#. module: account_payment_authorization
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:account_payment_authorization.action_account_payment_authorization_scheme
msgid ""
"Authorization schemes define, through a domain condition on\n"
"                the payment (including its linked vendor bill), which users\n"
"                must authorize a vendor payment before it can be confirmed,\n"
"                or whether it must always be blocked."
msgstr ""
"Los esquemas de autorización definen, a través de una condición domain\n"
"                sobre el pago (incluyendo la factura de proveedor vinculada),\n"
"                qué usuarios deben autorizar un pago a proveedor antes de que\n"
"                pueda confirmarse, o si debe bloquearse siempre."

